# Chancery Vercel project Root Directory is client-diocese. Keep the install
# tree out of the upload except the materialized openchurch-server directory:
# a leftover file: symlink at this path ENOENT-realpaths on `vercel deploy
# --prebuilt` (runs 35156967665 / 35158008263). See deploy-diocese in
# .github/workflows/ci.yml.
node_modules/*
!node_modules/openchurch-server
!node_modules/openchurch-server/**
